That's not Fort Ludios you're talking about; it's the Castle. (Fort
Ludios is a side branch accessed via a magic portal in a vault.)

Your only way onwards will be a source of level teleport.
Confused/cursed scroll of teleport is the most common source; you could
also use the Orb of Fate. You will need teleport control, or a lot of
tries, to succeed in going downwards rather than upwards.

